WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
Light Edge ends the prerequisite OD-Arc juggle.

2
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.200
Standing medium kick intentionally whiffs.

3
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:01.700
Standing heavy kick trades with Ryu’s recorded jab.

4
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.500
Standing heavy punch connects after the trade.

5
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.900
Heavy Vagabond Edge launches Ryu.

6
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.950
The air grab converts the trade juggle.

7
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:05.350
The branch ends in hard knockdown.
